  "prompt": "You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a complex, animated \"System Monitor\" dashboard with a heavy Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi aesthetic.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. Do not import external libraries (no React, no Tailwind, no external CSS). You may use Google Fonts (e.g., 'Share Tech Mono' or 'Orbitron').\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nLAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The layout must feature a permanent, fixed sidebar on the left side (approx 250px wide) containing a futuristic user profile and at least four functional-looking navigation buttons.\n2. The main content area must utilize a responsive CSS Grid structure to display at least three distinct data panels.\n\nAESTHETIC & GEOMETRIC SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The color palette must be dark mode: deep black backgrounds (#050505), with neon cyan, hot magenta, and toxic green accents.\n2. To achieve a seamless Sci-Fi look, the primary data panels must feature an inward-curving top corner (a custom border-radius or clip-path cut-out), giving it a highly structured, non-boxy appearance.\n3. Include a subtle, semi-transparent CSS \"scanline\" overlay across the entire viewport to simulate a CRT monitor.\n\nANIMATION & INTERACTIVITY SPECIFICATIONS (JavaScript required):\n1. Glitch Effect: The main dashboard header text must feature a CSS keyframe animation that occasionally \"glitches\" (splitting colors or offsetting text for a split second).\n2. Live Telemetry: One of the grid panels must contain a \"CPU/RAM Load\" bar chart or circular progress indicator. Use JavaScript to randomly update these values and animate the bars/circles every 800 milliseconds.\n3. Terminal Output: Another panel must act as a terminal window. Use JavaScript to automatically append simulated, matrix-style data logs (e.g., \"0x00FF... BYPASSING SECURITY...\") that scroll continuously.\n\nEnsure the final output is visually stunning, responsive, and immediately interactive upon loading.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>SYSTEM MONITOR \u2014 NEXUS CORE</title>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;500;700&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        /* ============================================================\n           BASE & RESET\n        ============================================================ */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            height: 100vh;\n            width: 100vw;\n            position: relative;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           CRT SCANLINE OVERLAY\n        ============================================================ */\n        .scanline-overlay {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(\n                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 0%,\n                transparent 1%\n            );\n            background-size: 100% 2px;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 1000;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           ANIMATION UTILITIES\n        ============================================================ */\n        @keyframes flicker {\n            0%, 18%, 20%, 22%, 24%, 26%, 30%, 32%, 34%, 36%, 38%, 40%, 42%, 44%, 46%, 48%, 50%, 52%, 54%, 56%, 58%, 60%, 62%, 64%, 66%, 68%, 70%, 72%, 74%, 76%, 78%, 80%, 82%, 84%, 86%, 88%, 90%, 92%, 94%, 96%, 100% {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n            18.5%, 20.5%, 22.5%, 24.5%, 26.5%, 28.5%, 30.5%, 32.5%, 34.5%, 36.5%, 38.5%, 40.5%, 42.5%, 44.5%, 46.5%, 48.5%, 50.5%, 52.5%, 54.5%, 56.5%, 58.5%, 60.5%, 62.5%, 64.5%, 66.5%, 68.5%, 70.5%, 72.5%, 74.5%, 76.5%, 78.5%, 80.5%, 82.5%, 84.5%, 86.5%, 88.5%, 90.5%, 92.5%, 94.5%, 96.5% {\n                opacity: 0.8;\n                transform: translateY(-2px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes glitch-text {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate(0);\n                filter: hue-rotate(0deg);\n            }\n            2% {\n                transform: translate(-3px, 2px);\n                filter: hue-rotate(15deg);\n            }\n            4% {\n                transform: translate(3px, -2px);\n                filter: hue-rotate(-10deg);\n            }\n            6% {\n                transform: translate(-3px, 0);\n                filter: hue-rotate(5deg);\n            }\n            8% {\n                transform: translate(2px, 1px);\n                filter: hue-rotate(-8deg);\n            }\n            10% {\n                transform: translate(0);\n                filter: hue-rotate(0deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-ring {\n            0% {\n                transform: scale(0.8);\n                opacity: 0.7;\n            }\n            50% {\n                opacity: 0.3;\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: scale(1.2);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes terminal-blink {\n            0%, 49% {\n                opacity: 0.8;\n            }\n            50%, 100% {\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes terminal-cursor {\n            0%, 49% {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: scaleY(1);\n            }\n            50%, 100% {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: scaleY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           SIDEBAR \u2014 LEFT NAVIGATION\n        ============================================================ */\n        .sidebar {\n            grid-column: 1;\n            height: 100vh;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #0e0e0e 100%);\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n            box-shadow: 4px 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 180, 0.08);\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__profile {\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__avatar {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #00f7ff, #a200ff);\n            border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #050505;\n            margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;\n            position: relative;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__avatar::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -3px;\n            left: -3px;\n            right: -3px;\n            bottom: -3px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid #00f7ff;\n            background: transparent;\n            animation: pulse-ring 3s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__name {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__title {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__nav {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__nav-item {\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            background: transparent;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__nav-item:hover {\n            background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            transform: translateX(4px);\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__nav-item.active {\n            background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            border-color: #00f7ff;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .sidebar__nav-icon {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            min-width: 24px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           MAIN CONTENT \u2014 GRID LAYOUT\n        ============================================================ */\n        .main {\n            grid-column: 2;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .main__header {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .main__header-title {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n            display: inline-block;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .main__header-title::after {\n            content: '\u2593\u2592\u2591';\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            color: #00f7ff;\n            opacity: 0.3;\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            animation: glitch-text 4s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .main__header-subtitle {\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            margin-top: 0.25rem;\n            display: block;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           PANEL \u2014 COMPUTER RESOURCES (CPU/RAM)\n        ============================================================ */\n        .panel {\n            background: #0a0a0a;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .panel::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -12px;\n            left: -12px;\n            right: -12px;\n            height: 24px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 50%, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1) 50%);\n            border-top-left-radius: 8px;\n            border-top-right-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .panel__title {\n            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .panel__title-icon {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            color: #00f7ff;\n        }\n\n        /* CPU/RAM Panel */\n        .panel-resources {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .resource-group {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .resource-label {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .resource-value {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .progress-container {\n            height: 24px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar {\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #00f7ff, #a200ff);\n            width: 0%;\n            transition: width 0.5s ease-in-out;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            right: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            background: #00f7ff;\n        }\n\n        .progress-value {\n            font-size: 0.7rem;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-align: right;\n            padding-right: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           PANEL \u2014 TERMINAL LOG\n        ============================================================ */\n        .panel-terminal {\n            position: relative;\n            height: 300px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-title {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            color: #fff;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell {\n            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n            height: 220px;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            padding-right: 0.5rem;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 80%, transparent 100%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 80%, transparent 100%);\n            scrollbar-width: thin;\n            scrollbar-color: #00f7ff rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #00f7ff;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .log-entry {\n            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .timestamp {\n            color: #00f7ff;\n            font-size: 0.7rem;\n            margin-right: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .content {\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .highlight {\n            color: #a200ff;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .keyword {\n            color: #00ffa0;\n        }\n\n        .terminal-shell .cursor {\n            display: inline-block;\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 1.4em;\n            background: #00f7ff;\n            margin-left: 4px;\n            animation: terminal-cursor 1s infinite;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           PANEL \u2014 NETWORK STATUS\n        ============================================================ */\n        .panel-network {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .network-card {\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        .network-label {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .network-value {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-align: center;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .network-unit {\n            font-size: 0.7rem;\n            color: #a0a0a0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           STATUS INDICATORS\n        ============================================================ */\n        .status-indicator {\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin-right: 0.5rem;\n            vertical-align: middle;\n        }\n\n        .status-online {\n            background: #00ffa0;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 6px #00ffa0;\n            animation: flicker 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .status-offline {\n            background: #ff4040;\n        }\n\n        .status-warning {\n            background: #ffcc00;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           RESPONSIVE ADJUSTMENTS\n        ============================================================ */\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            body {\n                grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;\n            }\n            .main {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            body {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n            .sidebar {\n                grid-column: 1;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: 1rem;\n                position: relative;\n            }\n            .main {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                padding: 1rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           FONT ICONS (Pseudo-element based)\n        ============================================================ */\n        .icon-cpu:before { content: '\u26a1'; }\n        .icon-ram:before { content: '\ud83d\udcbe'; }\n        .icon-network:before { content: '\ud83c\udf10'; }\n        .icon-terminal:before { content: '\ud83d\udcbb'; }\n        .icon-dashboard:before { content: '\ud83d\udcca'; }\n        .icon-user:before { content: '\ud83d\udc64'; }\n        .icon-settings:before { content: '\u2699\ufe0f'; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"scanline-overlay\"></div>\n\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar__profile\">\n            <div class=\"sidebar__avatar\">NX</div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__name\">NEXUS OPERATOR</div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__title\">SYSTEM ADMIN \u2014 LEVEL 9</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"sidebar__nav\">\n            <div class=\"sidebar__nav-item active\" data-tab=\"dashboard\">\n                <span class=\"sidebar__nav-icon icon-dashboard\"></span>\n                <span>DASHBOARD</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__nav-item\" data-tab=\"monitor\">\n                <span class=\"sidebar__nav-icon icon-cpu\"></span>\n                <span>SYSTEM MONITOR</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__nav-item\" data-tab=\"network\">\n                <span class=\"sidebar__nav-icon icon-network\"></span>\n                <span>NETWORK</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__nav-item\" data-tab=\"logs\">\n                <span class=\"sidebar__nav-icon icon-terminal\"></span>\n                <span>TERMINAL LOGS</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar__nav-item\" data-tab=\"settings\">\n                <span class=\"sidebar__nav-icon icon-settings\"></span>\n                <span>SETTINGS</span>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"main\">\n        <div class=\"main__header\">\n            <h1 class=\"main__header-title\">NEXUS CORE \u2014 SYSTEM MONITOR</h1>\n            <span class=\"main__header-subtitle\">REAL-TIME TELEMETRY | CYCLE 4471 | STATUS: ONLINE</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"panel panel-resources\">\n            <div class=\"panel__title\">\n                <span class=\"panel__title-icon icon-cpu\"></span>\n                <span>COMPUTER RESOURCES</span>\n                <span class=\"status-indicator status-online\"></span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"resource-group\">\n                <div class=\"resource-label\">\n                    <span>CPU LOAD</span>\n                    <span id=\"cpu-value\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"progress-container\">\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"cpu-bar\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"progress-value\" id=\"cpu-percent\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"resource-group\">\n                <div class=\"resource-label\">\n                    <span>RAM USAGE</span>\n                    <span id=\"ram-value\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"progress-container\">\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"ram-bar\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"progress-value\" id=\"ram-percent\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"resource-group\">\n                <div class=\"resource-label\">\n                    <span>GPU LOAD</span>\n                    <span id=\"gpu-value\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"progress-container\">\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"gpu-bar\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"progress-value\" id=\"gpu-percent\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"resource-group\">\n                <div class=\"resource-label\">\n                    <span>STORAGE</span>\n                    <span id=\"storage-value\">00GB / 00GB</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"progress-container\">\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"storage-bar\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"progress-value\" id=\"storage-percent\">00%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"panel panel-terminal\">\n            <div class=\"terminal-header\">\n                <div class=\"terminal-title\">\n                    <span class=\"panel__title-icon icon-terminal\"></span>\n                    <span>SYSTEM TERMINAL</span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"status-indicator status-online\"></span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"terminal-shell\" id=\"terminal-shell\">\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.001]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">NEXUS CORE v4.7.2 \u2014 INITIALIZED</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.002]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">LOADING MODULE: <span class=\"highlight\">CORE.TELEMETRY</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.003]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">LOADING MODULE: <span class=\"highlight\">NETWORK.INTERFACE</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.004]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">LOADING MODULE: <span class=\"highlight\">SECURITY.AUTH</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.005]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">ALL MODULES LOADED \u2014 SYSTEM READY</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.006]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">WATCHING: <span class=\"keyword\">/var/log/system</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.007]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">WATCHING: <span class=\"keyword\">/var/log/security</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.008]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">WATCHING: <span class=\"keyword\">/var/log/network</span>...</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.009]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">TERMINAL READY \u2014 AWAITING INPUT</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"log-entry\">\n                    <span class=\"timestamp\">[0x00FF:4471.010]</span>\n                    <span class=\"content\">> _</span><span class=\"cursor\"></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"panel panel-network\">\n            <div class=\"panel__title\">\n                <span class=\"panel__title-icon icon-network\"></span>\n                <span>NETWORK STATUS</span>\n                <span class=\"status-indicator status-online\"></span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"network-card\">\n                <div class=\"network-label\">UPLOAD BANDWIDTH</div>\n                <div class=\"network-value\" id=\"upload-value\">0.00</div>\n                <div class=\"network-unit\">Mbps</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"network-card\">\n                <div class=\"network-label\">DOWNLOAD BANDWIDTH</div>\n                <div class=\"network-value\" id=\"download-value\">0.00</div>\n                <div class=\"network-unit\">Mbps</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"network-card\">\n                <div class=\"network-label\">PACKETS/R</div>\n                <div class=\"network-value\" id=\"packets-value\">0</div>\n                <div class=\"network-unit\">pkt/sec</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"network-card\">\n                <div class=\"network-label\">LATENCY</div>\n                <div class=\"network-value\" id=\"latency-value\">0</div>\n                <div class=\"network-unit\">ms</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        /* ============================================================\n           DOM ELEMENTS\n        ============================================================ */\n        const cpuBar = document.getElementById('cpu-bar');\n        const cpuValue = document.getElementById('cpu-value');\n        const cpuPercent = document.getElementById('cpu-percent');\n\n        const ramBar = document.getElementById('ram-bar');\n        const ramValue = document.getElementById('ram-value');\n        const ramPercent = document.getElementById('ram-percent');\n\n        const gpuBar = document.getElementById('gpu-bar');\n        const gpuValue = document.getElementById('gpu-value');\n        const gpuPercent = document.getElementById('gpu-percent');\n\n        const storageBar = document.getElementById('storage-bar');\n        const storageValue = document.getElementById('storage-value');\n        const storagePercent = document.getElementById('storage-percent');\n\n        const uploadValue = document.getElementById('upload-value');\n        const downloadValue = document.getElementById('download-value');\n        const packetsValue = document.getElementById('packets-value');\n        const latencyValue = document.getElementById('latency-value');\n\n        const terminalShell = document.getElementById('terminal-shell');\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           UTILITY FUNCTIONS\n        ============================================================ */\n        function getRandomInt(min, max) {\n            return Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n        }\n\n        function formatBytes(bytes, decimals = 2) {\n            if (bytes === 0) return '0';\n            const k = 1024;\n            const dm = decimals < 0 ? 0 : decimals;\n            const sizes = ['B', 'KB', 'MB', 'GB', 'TB', 'PB', 'EB', 'ZB', 'YB'];\n            const i = Math.floor(Math.log(bytes) / Math.log(k));\n            return parseFloat((bytes / Math.pow(k, i)).toFixed(dm)) + ' ' + sizes[i];\n        }\n\n        const logTemplates = [\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [SYSTEM] BOOTING MODULE: {module}...',\n                module: ['CORE.TELEMETRY', 'NETWORK.INTERFACE', 'SECURITY.AUTH', 'IO.SUBSYSTEM', 'CRYPTO.ENGINE', 'DISPLAY.RENDER']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [NETWORK] INCOMING CONNECTION FROM: {ip}',\n                ip: ['192.168.1.47', '10.0.0.133', '203.0.113.7', '172.16.254.1', '::ffff:192.0.2.12']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [SECURITY] AUTHENTICATION: {status} \u2014 USER: {user}',\n                status: ['SUCCESS', 'FAILED', 'RETRY', 'LOCKED'],\n                user: ['NEXUS_OP', 'FIREWALL_SVC', 'LOG_AGENT', 'CRON_JOB']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [TELEMETRY] CPU: {cpu}% | RAM: {ram}% | TEMP: {temp}\u00b0C',\n                cpu: [12, 45, 67, 23, 89],\n                ram: [34, 67, 12, 89, 45],\n                temp: [42, 65, 38, 71, 53]\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [CRYPTO] ENCRYPTING SESSION KEY: {key}...',\n                key: ['0xA3F7B2C1', '0xE8D4C9A3', '0xB1E2F4C7', '0xD6C3A1E9', '0xF2A8B4C3']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [IO] WRITE OPERATION: {path} \u2014 {size}',\n                path: ['/var/data/blockchain/0x1234', '/opt/nexus/cache/render_4k', '/home/operator/.config/enc_key'],\n                size: ['4.2GB', '1.7GB', '893MB', '2.4TB', '67MB']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [DEBUG] VARIABLE DUMP: {var} = \"{value}\"',\n                var: ['session_token', 'node_address', 'encryption_mode', 'log_level', 'heartbeat_interval'],\n                value: ['7a2f-4e1c-bb9e', 'node-0x7f3a', 'AES-256-GCM', 'VERBOSE', '1500ms']\n            },\n            {\n                pattern: '[0x00FF:4471.{time}] [ALERT] \u26a0\ufe0f  {alert_type}: {message}',\n                alert_type: ['HIGH CPU', 'DISK CRITICAL', 'NETWORK SPIKE', 'SECURITY BREACH', 'THERMAL WARNING'],\n                message: ['Process \"render_worker\" exceeded 95% CPU threshold', 'Root partition at 91.2% capacity', 'Upload bandwidth surged to 847 Mbps', 'Unauthorized access attempt from 10.0.0.133', 'Core temperature reached 88\u00b0C \u2014 consider cooling']\n            }\n        ];\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           ANIMATE TERMINAL TEXT\n        ============================================================ */\n        function animateTerminal() {\n            const entries = terminalShell.querySelectorAll('.log-entry');\n            entries.forEach((entry, index) => {\n                const delay = index * 0.05;\n                entry.style.animationDelay = `${delay}s`;\n            });\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           UPDATE TELEMETRY DATA\n        ============================================================ */\n        function updateTelemetry() {\n            // CPU\n            const cpu = getRandomInt(15, 85);\n            cpuBar.style.width = `${cpu}%`;\n            cpuValue.textContent = `${cpu}%`;\n            cpuPercent.textContent = `${cpu}%`;\n\n            // RAM\n            const ram = getRandomInt(30, 75);\n            ramBar.style.width = `${ram}%`;\n            ramValue.textContent = `${ram}%`;\n            ramPercent.textContent = `${ram}%`;\n\n            // GPU\n            const gpu = getRandomInt(10, 60);\n            gpuBar.style.width = `${gpu}%`;\n            gpuValue.textContent = `${gpu}%`;\n            gpuPercent.textContent = `${gpu}%`;\n\n            // Storage\n            const storageUsed = getRandomInt(20, 80);\n            const storageTotal = getRandomInt(90, 120);\n            storageBar.style.width = `${storageUsed}%`;\n            storageValue.textContent = `${storageUsed}GB / ${storageTotal}GB`;\n            storagePercent.textContent = `${storageUsed}%`;\n\n            // Network\n            uploadValue.textContent = `${getRandomInt(10, 80).toFixed(2)}`;\n            downloadValue.textContent = `${getRandomInt(50, 200).toFixed(2)}`;\n            packetsValue.textContent = `${getRandomInt(1000, 9000)}`;\n            latencyValue.textContent = `${getRandomInt(1, 45)}`;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           GENERATE TERMINAL LOG ENTRIES\n        ============================================================ */\n        let terminalCycle = 0;\n\n        function generateLogEntry() {\n            terminalCycle++;\n            const template = logTemplates[getRandomInt(0, logTemplates.length - 1)];\n            let entry = template.pattern;\n\n            // Replace placeholders\n            for (const key in template) {\n                if (key !== 'pattern' && template[key]) {\n                    const values = template[key];\n                    const value = Array.isArray(values)\n                        ? values[getRandomInt(0, values.length - 1)]\n                        : getRandomInt(0, 100);\n                    entry = entry.replace(`{${key}}`, value);\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Replace time\n            entry = entry.replace('{time}', String(terminalCycle).padStart(3, '0'));\n\n            // Create DOM element\n            const logEntry = document.createElement('div');\n            logEntry.className = 'log-entry';\n            logEntry.innerHTML = entry;\n\n            terminalShell.appendChild(logEntry);\n\n            // Auto-scroll to bottom\n            terminalShell.scrollTop = terminalShell.scrollHeight;\n\n            // Animate the new entry\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                logEntry.style.animation = 'flicker 0.5s ease-in-out';\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    logEntry.style.animation = '';\n                }, 500);\n            }, 10);\n\n            // Remove oldest entries if too many\n            const entries = terminalShell.querySelectorAll('.log-entry');\n            if (entries.length > 40) {\n                terminalShell.removeChild(entries[0]);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           NAVIGATION TOGGLE\n        ============================================================ */\n        document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar__nav-item').forEach(item => {\n            item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar__nav-item').forEach(i => {\n                    i.classList.remove('active');\n                });\n                item.classList.add('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        /* ============================================================\n           INITIALIZE DASHBOARD\n        ============================================================ */\n        function initDashboard() {\n            // Initial telemetry\n            updateTelemetry();\n\n            // Glitch animation on header\n            const headerTitle = document.querySelector('.main__header-title');\n            let glitchInterval = setInterval(() => {\n                headerTitle.style.animation = 'glitch-text 0.3s ease-in-out';\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    headerTitle.style.animation = '';\n                }, 300);\n            }, 15000);\n\n            // Periodic telemetry updates\n            setInterval(updateTelemetry, 800);\n\n            // Periodic terminal log generation\n            setInterval(generateLogEntry, 500);\n\n            // Initial terminal animation\n            animateTerminal();\n        }\n\n        // Start on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initDashboard);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
